#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:10
msgid "Borrowing, streams, progress and observations"
msgstr "借用、流、推进与观测"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:12
msgid ""
"Accepted requests and buffers remain borrowed until acquire-observed "
"SETTLED. Cancellation, deadline expiry and DMA completion do not revoke a "
"borrow. Applications own progress, waiting and joined shutdown; diagnostics "
"report observations rather than creating a worker."
msgstr ""
"已接受的请求和缓冲区在以 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED 前持续借用。取消、截止时间到期和 DMA "
"完成均不撤销借用。应用负责推进、等待及完成 join 的停机；诊断只报告观测，不创建工作线程。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:17
msgid ""
"A valid request snapshot has a nonzero epoch and finite `observed_at`; its "
"`deadline` may be `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` to mean no deadline. SERVICE facts "
"require finite `last_service_at` and `observed_at` in the same monotonic "
"domain, and a finite positive `maximum_service_gap_us`. Unknown groups stay "
"unknown."
msgstr ""
"有效 request 快照具有非零 epoch 和有限 `observed_at`；其 `deadline` 可以为 "
"`NX_DEADLINE_NEVER`，表示无期限。SERVICE 事实要求 `last_service_at` 与 `observed_at` "
"在同一单调时钟域中且均为有限值，`maximum_service_gap_us` 为有限正值。未知事实组保持未知。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:22
msgid ""
"Selected readonly facts use stable public domain types. Optional factory "
"lookups return concrete records; manually supplied providers can supply the "
"same types. Read these constraints when binding a component, then retain the"
" selected provider's normal admission checks. A record does not establish "
"readiness, resource ownership, measured timing or physical qualification. "
"Unknown bounds never mean unlimited support. Generic capabilities use "
"`nx_io_capability_t` and `NX_IO_CAP_*`; enhanced SPI endpoints use "
"transaction traits, while I2C uses explicit `nx_i2c_limits_t` provider "
"profiles."
msgstr ""
"所选只读事实使用稳定公共领域类型。可选 factory 查询返回具体记录；手工提供的 provider "
"可使用同样类型。绑定组件时读取这些约束，执行时仍保留所选 provider 正常准入检查。记录不证明 "
"ready、资源所有权、实测时序或物理资格。未知限额不表示无限支持。通用 capability 使用 `nx_io_capability_t` 和 "
"`NX_IO_CAP_*`；增强 SPI endpoint 使用事务 traits，I2C 使用明确的 `nx_i2c_limits_t` "
"provider profile。"

