#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:35
msgid "Optional zero-initialized sidecar; no default provider state grows."
msgstr "可选的零初始化附属状态；默认提供者状态不增加。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:35
msgid ""
"One physical vector or one unique task executor writes each sidecar. "
"Different nested vectors require distinct sidecars. NMI, HardFault, other "
"cores and other security states must not access this storage. Reset/reclaim "
"only after all producers, tokens and readers have joined."
msgstr ""
"每个 sidecar 由一个物理向量或一个唯一任务执行者写入。不同嵌套向量必须使用不同 "
"sidecar。NMI、HardFault、其他核及其他安全状态不得访问此存储。只有全部生产者、token 和读者退出后，才能复位或回收。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:35
msgid "Zero-initialized stack token; do not copy or rebind while active."
msgstr "零初始化栈令牌；活动期间不得复制或重新绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:39
msgid "diagnostic.h"
msgstr "diagnostic.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "Explicit copied facts explain pending I/O without recovery."
msgstr "显式复制事实解释待处理 I/O，不执行恢复。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "Classify supplied observations without touching live I/O."
msgstr "分类给定观察，不访问实际 I/O。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded fixed work, no MMIO, locks, allocation, service or "
"recovery. Deadline and quarantine never revoke an accepted borrow. Callers "
"must still drain controls and join observers before storage reuse."
msgstr ""
"任务／IRQ 中执行固定有界工作，不访问 MMIO、不加锁、不分配、不执行 service 或恢复。deadline 与 quarantine "
"从不撤销已接受的借用。重用存储前，调用者仍必须排空控制路径并 join observer。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "[in] Stable aligned copies; no pointer is retained."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且对齐的副本；不保留指针。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "[out] Aligned output distinct from every input span."
msgstr "[out] 已对齐输出，与全部输入区间分离。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed facts/alias, STATE for reversed service time."
" Rejection leaves output unchanged."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS；事实格式错误或发生别名时返回 INVALID；service 时间倒退时返回 STATE。拒绝保持输出不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "Optional stable reason key for exactly one finding bit."
msgstr "可选的稳定原因 key，仅接受一个 finding 位。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "Task/IRQ constant work, no formatting or allocation."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中执行固定工作量，不格式化或分配。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "[in] One NX_IO_DIAG flag, never a combined mask."
msgstr "[in] 一个 NX_IO_DIAG 标志，不能是组合掩码。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "Immutable static text, or NULL for zero/unknown/many bits."
msgstr "返回不可变静态文本；零、未知位或多个位返回 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "Stable caller copies, with independently known fact groups."
msgstr "稳定的调用者副本，各事实组独立声明已知。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid ""
"request/stream may be NULL; their presence establishes the corresponding "
"group. known accepts only LIFECYCLE, OWNER, SERVICE and OBSERVERS. Zero-"
"initialized unknown values never establish readiness, health or a missed "
"service. OWNER fields may come from an owner observer only when its "
"diagnostic_result succeeded. They describe admission and pending work, not "
"the cause of a BUSY service result. SERVICE timestamps use the same "
"monotonic domain; both are finite and maximum_service_gap_us is a finite "
"positive declared budget. This helper reads no clock itself. Copies remain "
"stable throughout this call. Observations need not be simultaneous across "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"request／stream 可以为 NULL；存在时对应事实组即已知。known 仅接受 LIFECYCLE、OWNER、SERVICE 和 "
"OBSERVERS。置零的未知值不能建立 ready、健康或漏调 service 的事实。OWNER 字段只有在 owner observer 的 "
"diagnostic_result 成功时才能来自该观察；它们描述准入与待处理工作，不解释 service 返回 BUSY 的原因。SERVICE "
"时间戳使用同一单调时钟域，两者均为有限值，maximum_service_gap_us "
"是声明的有限正预算。该函数不自行读取时钟。副本在本次调用期间保持稳定；不同设备的观察不必同时发生。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid "Independent findings and unavailable fact groups."
msgstr "独立 finding 与不可用事实组。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:41
msgid ""
"Zero findings is not a health certificate. SETTLED does not establish "
"successful I/O or joined observers. Outstanding stream blocks include "
"producer, ready and consumer loans; cursor busy describes only the ordinary "
"stream cursor. Loss is pending stream metadata in this snapshot, not a "
"cumulative total; publication moves it into a later block."
msgstr ""
"零 finding 不是健康证明。SETTLED 不建立 I/O 成功或 observer 已 join 的事实。未结清 stream "
"块包含生产者、ready 和消费者借用；cursor busy 仅描述普通 stream cursor。Loss 是此快照尚未发布的 stream "
"元数据，不是累计总数；发布会把它转移到之后的块中。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:45
msgid "dma.h"
msgstr "dma.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Explicit DMA memory domains, physical streams and drain facts."
msgstr "显式 DMA 内存域、物理流与排空事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Enums"
msgstr "枚举"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Transfer direction determines device access to caller memory."
msgstr "传输方向决定设备对调用者内存的访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Validate an entire buffer within one explicit memory domain."
msgstr "验证整个缓冲区位于一个显式内存域内。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Bounded task/IRQ check, no MMIO, allocation or side effects."
msgstr "任务或 IRQ 中的有界检查，无 MMIO、分配或副作用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Immutable SoC domains kept alive for this call."
msgstr "[in] 不可变的 SoC 域，在此调用期间保持存活。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Positive number of domains."
msgstr "[in] 正的域数量。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Nonempty caller buffer; never borrowed by this helper."
msgstr "[in] 调用方的非空缓冲区；此 helper 绝不借用它。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Positive byte length, including all DMA accesses."
msgstr "[in] 正字节长度，包含所有 DMA 访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Nonzero power-of-two transfer alignment."
msgstr "[in] 非零且为 2 的幂的传输对齐。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Device reads or writes the supplied memory."
msgstr "[in] 设备读取或写入所提供的内存。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"Success, INVALID for malformed ranges/alignment or PERMISSION for a range "
"outside the required DMA domain."
msgstr "成功；范围或对齐格式错误返回 INVALID；范围不在所需 DMA 域内返回 PERMISSION。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Check an explicit owned reservation and its DMA payload."
msgstr "检查显式拥有的 reservation 及其 DMA payload。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ validation, no allocation/cache operation. Callers "
"exclusively own all lines and padding until drain and acquire-observed "
"SETTLED. This validates geometry only; it cannot prove ownership or replace "
"provider admission, actual cache geometry, mode-specific length checks or "
"cache maintenance. Cancellation never releases that obligation."
msgstr ""
"任务／IRQ 中进行有界验证，不分配或操作 cache。调用者独占全部 cache line 和填充区域，直到排空并 acquire 观察到 "
"SETTLED。此处仅验证几何，不能证明所有权，也不能替代 provider 准入、真实 cache 几何、模式长度检查或 cache "
"维护。取消不解除该义务。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Immutable reviewed SoC DMA domains, not retained."
msgstr "[in] 不可变且已复核的 SoC DMA 域，不保留。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Positive domain count."
msgstr "[in] 正的域数量。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Caller-owned reservation, distinct from live loans."
msgstr "[in] 调用者拥有的 reservation，与实际存活的借用区间分离。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Whole reservation bytes, including owned padding."
msgstr "[in] 完整 reservation 字节数，包含自有填充区域。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Positive payload size, at most capacity."
msgstr "[in] 正的 payload 长度，不超过 capacity。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"[in] Zero for no cache constraint, otherwise a reviewed power-of-two line "
"size; address and capacity must be exact multiples. The helper never rounds "
"ranges."
msgstr ""
"[in] 零表示无 cache 约束；否则为已复核、二次幂的 cache line 大小，地址和 capacity "
"必须是其整数倍。辅助函数从不对区间取整。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Device access permission for the whole storage."
msgstr "[in] 完整存储的设备访问权限。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or PERMISSION; no memory access or borrow."
msgstr "返回 SUCCESS、INVALID 或 PERMISSION；不访问或借用内存。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Reject duplicate physical streams in an assembled resource set."
msgstr "拒绝装配资源集合中重复的物理流。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"Cold conflict check; the selected SoC must validate all identities against "
"its actual topology before using them. This helper does not infer silicon "
"support or allocate."
msgstr "冷态冲突检查；选中 SoC 在使用前必须依据真实拓扑验证全部标识。此 helper 不推断芯片支持，也不分配。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Immutable resource list, not retained."
msgstr "[in] 不可变资源列表，不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Resource count; zero allows a NULL list."
msgstr "[in] 资源数量；为零时允许 NULL 列表。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"Success, INVALID for a NULL nonempty list or reserved zero controller, BUSY "
"for a duplicate physical engine."
msgstr "成功；非空列表为 NULL 或使用保留的零控制器时返回 INVALID；物理引擎重复时返回 BUSY。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Require engine, IRQ and peripheral drain independently."
msgstr "分别要求 DMA 引擎、IRQ 与外设排空。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"The provider must observe actual registers and ordering before setting these"
" facts. This helper does not stop hardware."
msgstr "provider 必须先观察实际寄存器及顺序，才能设置这些事实。此 helper 不会停止硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "[in] Provider observations; not retained."
msgstr "[in] provider 的观察结果；不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"Success only when all sources are detached and idle, BUSY while any source "
"remains, INVALID for impossible counters."
msgstr "仅在全部源已分离且空闲时成功；任何源仍存在时返回 BUSY；不可能的计数器值返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Reviewed DMA-visible memory interval, never CPU accessibility."
msgstr "已审查的 DMA 可见内存区间，不等同于 CPU 可访问性。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"begin plus size must not wrap. Cache maintenance remains a provider "
"responsibility on cached architectures."
msgstr "begin 加 size 不得回绕。在带缓存的架构上，缓存维护仍是 provider 的责任。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Opaque physical engine and request selector identities."
msgstr "不透明物理引擎与请求选择器身份。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"Controller zero is reserved as invalid. Other values have provider-defined "
"meanings; the SoC validates its topology. Two selectors on the same "
"controller/stream conflict."
msgstr ""
"控制器零保留为无效值。其他值的含义由 provider 定义；SoC 验证自身拓扑。同一 controller/stream 上的两个 selector"
" 相互冲突。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid "Independent facts required before memory borrow release."
msgstr "释放内存借用前必须独立满足的事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:47
msgid ""
"remaining describes DMA memory transfers, not wire bytes. A zero counter "
"never establishes peripheral_idle."
msgstr "remaining 描述 DMA 内存传输，不是线上字节。计数器为零绝不证明 peripheral_idle。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:51
msgid "frame_stream.h"
msgstr "frame_stream.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Complete framed blocks and strided DMA consumer loans."
msgstr "完整 framed block 与带 stride 的 DMA consumer 借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:59
msgid "Typedefs"
msgstr "类型定义"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Immutable consumer block retained through final DMA access."
msgstr "不可变 consumer block 保留到最后一次 DMA 访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Zero-initialize before first acquisition. Keep this exact control live and "
"exclusively owned until release; copied tokens never authorize earlier reuse"
" or another instance."
msgstr "首次取得前置零初始化。本精确控制对象须持续有效并被独占，直到 release；复制的 token 从不授权提前复用或用于其他实例。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Memory representations; these values never configure a wire."
msgstr "存储表示；这些值从不配置线路。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Serial framing whose complete units determine block geometry."
msgstr "以完整单元确定 block geometry 的串行帧格式。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Position of useful sample bits in each stored slot container."
msgstr "每个已存储 slot 容器中有效 sample 位的位置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Compute complete audio storage without touching payload."
msgstr "计算完整音频存储，不访问 payload。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded pure calculation. No format conversion, serializer "
"configuration or codec negotiation is performed."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中的有界纯计算。不进行格式转换、串行器配置或 codec 协商。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Explicit framing, sample and stored slot geometry."
msgstr "[in] 显式 framing、sample 与已存储 slot geometry。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[out] Separate fresh output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立的新输出；拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for incompatible framing or EXHAUSTED on arithmetic "
"overflow; never retains an input or allocates."
msgstr "SUCCESS；不兼容 framing 返回 INVALID，算术溢出返回 EXHAUSTED；从不保留输入或分配存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Check and copy planar/strided frame geometry."
msgstr "检查并复制平面／stride frame geometry。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Bounded pure calculation. Pixel/color meanings remain with the selected "
"camera/display/DMA adapter."
msgstr "有界纯计算。Pixel／color 的含义由所选 camera／display／DMA adapter 定义。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] 1..NX_FRAME_MAX_PLANES immutable plane descriptions."
msgstr "[in] 1..NX_FRAME_MAX_PLANES 个不可变 plane 描述。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Exact plane count, not a runtime pool maximum."
msgstr "[in] 精确 plane 数，不是运行期 pool 上限。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[out] Fresh output, unchanged on every rejection."
msgstr "[out] 新输出；所有拒绝都保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for empty/overlapping/short-stride planes, or EXHAUSTED on "
"byte arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS；空 plane、重叠或 stride 太短返回 INVALID，字节算术溢出返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Cold-bind a complete-frame layout to an existing queue."
msgstr "将完整 frame 布局冷态绑定到既有队列。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Task-only cold assembly, O(n squared) storage checks. No hardware or DMA-"
"domain admission is inferred. Keep all queue/control/payload storage live "
"through final stop."
msgstr ""
"仅任务上下文的冷态装配，以 O(n²) 检查存储。不据此推断硬件或 DMA 域准入。全部 queue／control／payload "
"存储须持续有效，直到最终 stop。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[out] Fresh control disjoint from queue and payloads."
msgstr "[out] 与 queue 和 payload 分离的新控制对象。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed queue with all slots free."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、未被借用且全部 slot 空闲的 queue。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Checked complete-frame geometry, copied on success."
msgstr "[in] 已检查的完整 frame geometry，成功时复制。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for aliases/short buffers/bad layout, BUSY for outstanding "
"blocks or STATE while stopping."
msgstr "SUCCESS；重叠、缓冲区短或布局错误返回 INVALID；未结束的 block 返回 BUSY，正在 stop 返回 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Publish one complete frame after final producer access."
msgstr "在 producer 最终访问之后发布一个完整 frame。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ metadata. Reserve/prepost/abort still use the existing "
"stream; publication always has exact frame size."
msgstr ""
"任务／IRQ 中的有界 metadata 操作。Reserve／prepost／abort 仍使用既有 stream；发布始终具有精确 frame "
"大小。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[inout] Exclusive serialized producer binding."
msgstr "[inout] 独占串行化 producer binding。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Existing stream producer loan, detached from all DMA."
msgstr "[in] 既有 stream producer 借用，已从所有 DMA 分离。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Existing observed stream boundary flags."
msgstr "[in] 已观察到的既有 stream 边界 flags。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Existing stream result; rejection retains the fill loan."
msgstr "既有 stream 结果；拒绝保留 fill 借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Publish one complete frame from the existing posted FIFO."
msgstr "从既有 posted FIFO 发布一个完整 frame。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Bounded task/IRQ metadata; preserves pending and FIFO counts."
msgstr "任务／IRQ 中的有界 metadata 操作；保留 pending 与 FIFO 计数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[inout] Same producer binding and complete-frame layout."
msgstr "[inout] 同一 producer binding 和完整 frame 布局。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[inout] Existing posted producer bound to this stream."
msgstr "[inout] 已绑定此 stream 的既有 posted producer。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Oldest pending loan, absent from all hardware targets."
msgstr "[in] 最旧的 pending 借用，已不在任何硬件 target 中。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Observed existing stream boundary flags."
msgstr "[in] 已观察到的既有 stream 边界 flags。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Existing posted-publication result, INVALID for foreign pool."
msgstr "既有 posted 发布结果；外部 pool 返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Acquire the next complete immutable DMA consumer loan."
msgstr "取得下一个完整且不可变的 DMA consumer 借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ; output disjointness scans the fixed pool in O(n) before the O(1) "
"guarded queue operation. Output cannot alias queue controls or any full-"
"capacity pool payload. EMPTY creates no loan and never repeats a previous "
"frame. Caller owns silence/blanking/stop policy. Do not use retries as "
"additional observed boundaries."
msgstr ""
"任务／IRQ 上下文；先以 O(n) 扫描固定 pool 检查输出是否分离，再执行有保护的 O(1) queue 操作。输出不能与 queue "
"control 或任何 pool payload 的完整容量范围重叠。EMPTY 不建立借用，也从不重复上一 "
"frame。调用者负责静音／blanking／stop 策略。不能把重试当作额外观察到的边界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"[inout] Same serialized consumer, one call per observed output boundary when"
" using underrun accounting."
msgstr "[inout] 同一串行化 consumer；使用 underrun 计数时，每个观察到的输出边界调用一次。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[inout] Zero or previously released control, unchanged on error."
msgstr "[inout] 置零或已 release 的控制对象；错误时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, EMPTY with saturating underrun count, BUSY for a live loan, INVALID"
" for output alias or STATE for an incomplete queued block."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；EMPTY 同时饱和累计 underrun；活跃借用返回 BUSY，输出重叠返回 INVALID，队列 block 不完整返回 "
"STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Derive a strided byte rectangle from a live frame loan."
msgstr "从活跃 frame 借用派生带 stride 的字节矩形。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ; an O(n) immutable-pool output check precedes the O(1) guarded view"
" calculation. Output cannot alias the loan, queue controls or any full-"
"capacity pool payload. The adapter checks pixel alignment, resource and DMA "
"domain."
msgstr ""
"任务／IRQ 上下文；先以 O(n) 在不可变 pool 中检查输出，再执行有保护的 O(1) view 计算。输出不能与借用、queue "
"control 或任何 pool payload 的完整容量范围重叠。Adapter 检查 pixel 对齐、资源及 DMA 域。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Exact live immutable DMA consumer loan."
msgstr "[in] 精确、活跃且不可变的 DMA consumer 借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Plane index in the bound layout."
msgstr "[in] 已绑定布局中的 plane 索引。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Byte column within a row, not a pixel count."
msgstr "[in] 行内字节列，不是 pixel 数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] First complete row."
msgstr "[in] 第一个完整行。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Positive bytes per selected row."
msgstr "[in] 每个所选行的正字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[in] Positive selected row count."
msgstr "[in] 正的所选行数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[out] Fresh output unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 新输出；失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for out-of-plane rectangles or STATE for stale/foreign "
"loans; no DMA access begins here."
msgstr "SUCCESS；越出 plane 的矩形返回 INVALID，过期／外部借用返回 STATE；这里不启动 DMA 访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Release only after the adapter proves final DMA access."
msgstr "只有 adapter 证明最终 DMA 访问后才能 release。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ metadata. Timeout/cancel is not quiescence; failed drain "
"retains the queue borrow, including during stop. This helper checks proof "
"facts and does not stop hardware."
msgstr ""
"任务／IRQ 中的有界 metadata 操作。超时／取消不证明静止；排空失败保留 queue 借用，stop 期间也一样。此 helper "
"检查证明事实，不停止硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[inout] Original owner; another instance cannot release."
msgstr "[inout] 原所有者；其他实例不能 release。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "[inout] Exact acquired control, cleared only on success."
msgstr "[inout] 精确的已取得控制对象；仅成功时清除。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"[in] Actual provider observations of engine, IRQ and peripheral quiescence; "
"counter completion alone is not proof."
msgstr "[in] Provider 对 engine、IRQ 和外设静止的真实观察；单独的计数器完成不是证明。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, BUSY while any source remains, STATE for stale or foreign tokens, "
"or INVALID for impossible drain counters."
msgstr "SUCCESS；仍有来源时为 BUSY；过期或外部 token 为 STATE，不可能的 drain 计数为 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Immutable audio memory format, independent of codec policy."
msgstr "不可变音频存储格式，独立于 codec 策略。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"slots counts wire slots; slot_bits is the stored container width. I2S stores"
" both 16/32-bit slots even when only one is active. SAI has 1..32 wire slots"
" and stores only enabled active_slots samples in ascending slot order, in "
"8/16/32-bit containers. PDM has 1..8 byte-interleaved lanes; each byte holds"
" eight successive bits of one lane, so frames must divide by eight. PDM "
"active_slots selects valid lanes without compacting storage. Sample byte "
"order is explicitly declared."
msgstr ""
"slots 计算 wire slots，slot_bits 是存储容器宽度。I2S 即使只有一个 slot 有效也存储两个 16/32-bit "
"slot。SAI 有 1..32 个 wire slots，只按递增 slot 顺序将已启用 active_slots 样本存入 8/16/32-bit"
" 容器。PDM 有 1..8 条字节交错 lane；每字节包含一条 lane 的连续八个位，因此 frames 必须能被八整除。PDM "
"active_slots 选择有效 lane，但不压缩存储。样本字节序显式声明。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "One plane; the last row needs no trailing stride padding."
msgstr "一个 plane；最后一行不需要尾部 stride padding。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"row_bytes/stride are bytes, rows is a complete line count. A plane occupies "
"(rows - 1) * stride + row_bytes bytes."
msgstr ""
"row_bytes／stride 以字节计，rows 是完整行数。一个 plane 占用 (rows - 1) * stride + row_bytes"
" 字节。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Immutable frame geometry copied into a bound stream."
msgstr "复制进已绑定 stream 的不可变 frame geometry。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Plane intervals, including inter-row padding, cannot overlap. bytes is the "
"exact maximum plane end, not summed row bytes. Audio formats are separate "
"immutable caller metadata; this layout represents their checked complete-"
"unit storage."
msgstr ""
"Plane 区间含行间 padding，不能重叠。bytes 是精确的最大 plane 末端，不是各行字节数之和。Audio format "
"是独立且不可变的调用者 metadata；此布局表示经检查的完整单元存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Caller-owned binding; the existing stream owns every queue."
msgstr "调用者持有的 binding；既有 stream 拥有每个 queue。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid ""
"Initialize before publication. One serialized producer and consumer use "
"framed publish/acquire exclusively until stop. Hardware, queue capacity and "
"synchronization remain explicit."
msgstr ""
"发布前初始化。一个串行化 producer 和 consumer 仅使用 framed publish／acquire，直到 stop。硬件、queue"
" 容量和同步均须显式提供。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:53
msgid "Checked 2D byte rectangle for an explicit DMA adapter."
msgstr "供显式 DMA adapter 使用的已检查 2D 字节矩形。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:57
msgid "fwd.h"
msgstr "fwd.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:59
msgid "Lightweight identities for typed I/O faces."
msgstr "类型化 I/O face 的轻量身份。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:59
msgid ""
"Include the matching public header before accessing its layout, operations, "
"requests or value types. Forward identities neither construct nor acquire "
"any device."
msgstr "访问其布局、操作、请求或值类型前，须包含对应公共头文件。前置身份既不构造也不取得任何设备。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:59
msgid "Opaque identity; complete contracts live in its public header."
msgstr "不透明身份；完整合同位于其公共头文件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:63
msgid "observation.h"
msgstr "observation.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Explicit timestamp provenance and checked service dispatch."
msgstr "显式时间戳来源与经过检查的服务派发。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Observation location; software time never implies hardware SOF."
msgstr "观察位置；软件时间不表示硬件 SOF。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "A timing bound can straddle a budget without proving either side."
msgstr "时序界限可能跨越预算，无法证明满足预算或超出预算。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Compare two explicitly related observed events."
msgstr "比较两个关系已明确的观察事件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ pure constant work; no clock, hardware, allocation, lock or "
"reference retention. Inputs may coincide. The caller proves event pairing "
"and timestamp provenance. Different explicit source kinds may be compared to"
" observe delivery latency, without relabeling either observation."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ "
"中均为纯操作且工作量恒定；不读取时钟、不访问硬件、不分配、不加锁，也不保留引用。输入可以重合。调用方负责证明事件配对及时间戳来源。可以比较不同的显式来源种类以观察交付时延，但不得重新标记任一观察。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "[in] Stable aligned first fact, not concurrently modified."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、已对齐且未被并发修改的首个事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "[in] Stable last fact in the same domain, epoch and rate."
msgstr "[in] 同一时间域、epoch 和速率中稳定的末个事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "[out] Distinct aligned result, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 独立且已对齐的结果，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID for malformed/misaligned/overlapping storage, UNSUPPORTED "
"for UNKNOWN source, STATE for incompatible domains or reversed ticks, "
"EXHAUSTED for bound overflow."
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS；存储参数无效、未对齐或重叠时返回 INVALID；来源为 UNKNOWN 时返回 UNSUPPORTED；时钟域不兼容或 ticks "
"逆序时返回 STATE；边界溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Compare a complete timing-error interval with a budget."
msgstr "将完整时序误差区间与预算比较。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"Pure O(1) Task/IRQ work with no clock access or retention. WITHIN requires "
"upper <= maximum; EXCEEDED requires lower > maximum. An overlapping or "
"unknown error interval gives UNKNOWN. SUCCESS alone does not mean within "
"budget. The existing timestamp-owner/provenance contract applies: this does "
"not extend raw DWT, validate epoch continuity, synchronize sampling, "
"establish IRQ arrival or prove WCET."
msgstr ""
"纯 O(1) Task／IRQ 操作，不访问时钟、不保留引用。WITHIN 要求 upper <= maximum；EXCEEDED 要求 lower "
"> maximum。当 lower <= maximum < upper，或误差界未知时，结果为 UNKNOWN。SUCCESS "
"本身不表示满足预算。既有时间戳 owner／来源合同仍适用：本函数不扩展原始 DWT、不验证 epoch 连续性、不同步采样、不建立 IRQ "
"到达时刻，也不证明 WCET。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "[in] Stable aligned extended timestamp, causally paired."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且对齐的扩展时间戳，须与另一事实构成因果配对。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "[in] Stable aligned fact in the same domain/epoch/rate."
msgstr "[in] 同一 domain／epoch／rate 内稳定且对齐的事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "[in] Inclusive maximum, in the stated tick units."
msgstr "[in] 包含边界的最大值，单位为声明的 tick。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID/UNSUPPORTED/STATE as elapsed, or EXHAUSTED when the "
"uncertainty sum or upper bound cannot fit."
msgstr ""
"与 elapsed 相同的 SUCCESS、INVALID／UNSUPPORTED／STATE；不确定度之和或上界不可表示时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Dispatch the selected UART service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 UART 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"Same context, serialization and lifetime rules as ordinary service. SUCCESS "
"proves dispatch only, not progress, health, settlement or permission to "
"reclaim storage. This reads no request and adds no state, lock or hidden "
"worker."
msgstr ""
"与普通 service 采用相同的上下文、串行化和生命周期规则。SUCCESS "
"仅证明已派发，不证明进展、健康、结清或允许回收存储。不读取请求，不增加状态、锁或隐藏 worker。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "[in] Live immutable face and initialized provider state."
msgstr "[in] 仍然有效的不可变接口及已初始化的 provider 状态。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"SUCCESS after one dispatch, INVALID for malformed face, UNSUPPORTED when no "
"service method exists."
msgstr "一次派发后返回 SUCCESS；接口格式无效返回 INVALID，没有 service 方法返回 UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Dispatch the selected SPI service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 SPI 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"Same context and owner rules as nx_spi_port_service; SUCCESS establishes "
"dispatch only, never settlement."
msgstr "与 nx_spi_port_service 采用相同的上下文和所有者规则；SUCCESS 仅证明已派发，绝不代表结清。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "SUCCESS after dispatch, INVALID or UNSUPPORTED."
msgstr "派发后返回 SUCCESS，或返回 INVALID/UNSUPPORTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Dispatch the selected I2C service or explain its absence."
msgstr "派发选定的 I2C 服务，或说明服务缺失。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"Same context and owner rules as nx_i2c_port_service; SUCCESS establishes "
"dispatch only, never settlement."
msgstr "与 nx_i2c_port_service 采用相同的上下文和所有者规则；SUCCESS 仅证明已派发，绝不代表结清。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Explicit, caller-supplied time fact without clock access."
msgstr "由调用者明确提供的时间事实，不访问时钟。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"ticks is extended, monotonically increasing within one nonzero domain/epoch."
" Its owner extends counter wrap and changes epoch on reset, discontinuity or"
" rate change. Domain and epoch are assembly-local identities, not clocks "
"synchronized across cores, security domains or devices. UNKNOWN carries no "
"usable measurement. Frequency is exact stated ticks/second, not measured "
"accuracy. A known zero uncertainty states zero error; unknown uncertainty "
"has a separate flag. These facts do not establish physical precision, causal"
" pairing or event identity by themselves."
msgstr ""
"ticks 是扩展计数，在一个非零 domain/epoch 中单调递增。其所有者扩展计数器回绕，并在复位、不连续或速率变化时改变 "
"epoch。domain 和 epoch 是装配内身份，不表示跨核、安全域或设备同步的时钟。UNKNOWN 不提供可用测量。频率是精确声明的 "
"ticks/second，而非实测精度。已知且为零的不确定度表示零误差；未知不确定度使用独立标志。这些事实本身不能建立物理精度、因果配对或事件身份。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Delta in one common clock domain, with stated error bound."
msgstr "同一时钟域内的差值，带明确的误差界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"When uncertainty_known is false, uncertainty_ticks is zero and describes no "
"error bound. No conversion, rounding or synchronization across clocks is "
"implicit."
msgstr ""
"uncertainty_known 为 false 时，uncertainty_ticks 为零，不描述任何误差界限。不隐含时间转换、舍入或跨时钟同步。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid "Inclusive interval and budget comparison in the stated tick domain."
msgstr "在声明的 tick 域内比较包含边界的区间与预算。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:65
msgid ""
"lower/upper are usable only when delta.uncertainty_known is true. Otherwise "
"both are zero and verdict is UNKNOWN, never an exact zero."
msgstr ""
"仅当 delta.uncertainty_known 为 true 时 lower／upper 才可使用。否则两者均为零，verdict 为 "
"UNKNOWN，绝不表示精确的零。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:69
msgid "stream.h"
msgstr "stream.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Bounded caller-owned blocks with explicit producer/consumer loans."
msgstr "调用者拥有的有界块与显式生产者／消费者借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Initialize an unborrowed stream and exact supplied block array."
msgstr "初始化未借用的 stream 与准确供给的块数组。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Task-only cold assembly. This helper does not validate DMA domains; the "
"hardware provider must validate every block."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的冷装配。本辅助函数不验证 DMA 内存域；硬件 provider 必须验证每个块。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[out] Fresh storage, not visible to any producer/consumer."
msgstr "[out] 全新存储，尚未向任何生产者或消费者公开。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Buffers distinct from all control and slot metadata."
msgstr "[inout] 与全部控制及槽元数据分离的缓冲。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Positive exact block count, not a maximum pool size."
msgstr "[in] 正数精确块数，不是缓冲池最大数量。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Success or INVALID; never allocates or retains bad inputs."
msgstr "成功或 INVALID；不分配，也不保留无效输入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Reserve the next free block for one serialized producer."
msgstr "为一个串行生产者预留下一个空闲块。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Bounded task/IRQ metadata operation; payload writes occur outside the short "
"interrupt mask, within the returned loan."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界元数据操作；载荷写入在短暂中断屏蔽区之外、返回的借用范围内执行。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Live initialized stream with one producer."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化的活动流，只有一个生产者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[out] Producer loan valid until publish or proved abort."
msgstr "[out] 生产者借用，在 publish 或经证明的 abort 前有效。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Success, OVERFLOW without overwrite, STATE while stopping or EXHAUSTED when "
"the monotonic loan identity cannot advance."
msgstr "成功；OVERFLOW 不覆盖数据；停止时返回 STATE；单调借用身份无法递增时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Query the next physical slot without creating a loan or loss."
msgstr "查询下一个物理槽，不产生借用或丢失。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded hint. A producer still calls reserve before accessing "
"payload; another context must not race admission."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界提示。生产者仍须先调用 reserve 才能访问载荷；其他上下文不得与准入并发竞争。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Live initialized stream with one serialized producer."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动流，只有一个串行化生产者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "True only when admission is open and the next slot is free."
msgstr "仅在准入开放且下一个槽空闲时返回 true。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Latch explicitly observed dropped producer boundaries."
msgstr "锁存明确观察到的生产者丢弃边界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded. Saturates at UINT32_MAX; the next published block carries "
"LOSS independently of its useful payload length."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界操作。在 UINT32_MAX 饱和；下一个发布块携带 LOSS，与其有效载荷长度无关。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Live stream controlled by the serialized producer."
msgstr "[inout] 由串行化生产者控制的活动流。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Positive lost block/boundary count, never guessed bytes."
msgstr "[in] 丢失块或边界的正数数量，不能猜测字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Publish a complete block after all hardware writes detached."
msgstr "全部硬件写引用撤离后，发布完整块。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded. A DMA half/full flag is insufficient if the engine can "
"still write the published block. Consumer-visible block bytes stay immutable"
" until the consumer releases them."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ 中的有界操作。如果引擎仍能写入所发布的块，DMA 半完成/全完成标志就不足以证明可发布。消费者可见的块字节在消费者释放前保持不可变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Same serialized producer as reserve."
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的串行化生产者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Current producer loan, not retained after publication."
msgstr "[in] 当前生产者借用；发布后不再保留该令牌引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Positive produced bytes within the reserved capacity."
msgstr "[in] 预留容量范围内的正数已生产字节数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] IDLE/TRIGGER boundaries observed by the provider."
msgstr "[in] provider 实际观测到的 IDLE/TRIGGER 边界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Success, INVALID or STATE; failure retains producer ownership."
msgstr "成功、INVALID 或 STATE；失败时保留生产者所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Acquire the next ready block for one serialized consumer."
msgstr "一个串行消费者取得下一个就绪块。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ bounded metadata; consumer processing happens outside the mask. "
"Release may occur out of order without overwrite."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界元数据操作；消费者在屏蔽区外处理载荷。可乱序释放，且不会覆盖仍被持有的数据。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Live stream; consumer may drain during stop."
msgstr "[inout] 活动流；停止过程中消费者仍可排空。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[out] Immutable consumer loan with exact incarnation token."
msgstr "[out] 带精确代次令牌的不可变消费者借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Success, EMPTY or INVALID; empty creates no loan."
msgstr "成功、EMPTY 或 INVALID；空流不建立借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Release only the matching consumer incarnation after final use."
msgstr "最终使用之后，仅释放匹配的消费者实例世代。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Task/IRQ bounded; release is the consumer's final block access."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界操作；release 是消费者对该块的最后一次访问。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Same consumer owner; no remaining observers of block."
msgstr "[inout] 同一消费者所有者；不再有该块的剩余观测者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Exact acquired token, never a reconstructed pointer."
msgstr "[in] 精确的已获取令牌，不能重新拼装指针代替。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Success, STATE for stale/double release or INVALID."
msgstr "成功；过期或重复释放返回 STATE；也可能返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Abort a producer loan only after memory write sources detach."
msgstr "仅内存写入源撤离之后中止生产者借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Cancellation/deadline alone never establishes quiescence."
msgstr "仅取消或达到时限不能证明已静止。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Same producer owner as reserve."
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的生产者所有者。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Current exact loan."
msgstr "[in] 当前的精确借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] True only after provider proves DMA/IRQ stopped."
msgstr "[in] 仅在 provider 证明 DMA/IRQ 已停止后才为 true。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Success, BUSY without proven drain, STATE for a stale token."
msgstr "成功；排空未获证明时为 BUSY；令牌过期时为 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Close producer admission while retaining every outstanding loan."
msgstr "关闭生产者准入，保留每一个未结清借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ constant metadata work independent of block count. This operation "
"does not stop hardware or revoke loans."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的常量元数据工作量，与块数无关。本操作不停止硬件，也不撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Live control kept alive until final successful stop."
msgstr "[inout] 活动控制对象，须保持有效直到最后一次 stop 成功。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Success only when all blocks are free, BUSY until producers detach and "
"consumers drain/release, INVALID for bad control."
msgstr "仅在全部块空闲时成功；生产者引用撤离且消费者排空并释放之前返回 BUSY；控制对象无效时返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Bind a posted producer to a quiescent initialized stream."
msgstr "将预提交生产者绑定到静止、已初始化的 stream。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"Task-only cold binding. Caller owns exclusive producer rights and retains "
"control until all pending fills and IRQs drain."
msgstr "仅限任务上下文的冷绑定。调用方拥有排他生产者权限，并保留控制对象直到全部待填充操作及 IRQ 排空。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[out] Separate caller control, not aliased with buffers"
msgstr "[out] 独立的调用方控制对象，不得与缓冲建立别名"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Admission open, no outstanding producer/consumer loans"
msgstr "[inout] 准入已开放，且无未归还的生产者或消费者借用"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, BUSY or STATE; rejected output is untouched"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、BUSY 或 STATE；拒绝时输出不变"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Query the next preposted slot without a loan or guessed loss."
msgstr "查询下一个预提交槽，不产生借用或猜测丢失。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Bounded task/IRQ hint; still reserve before writing payload."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中的有界提示；写入载荷前仍须 reserve。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Same exclusive serialized producer"
msgstr "[in] 同一排他且串行化的生产者"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "True when the next reservation can succeed"
msgstr "下次预留可以成功时返回 true"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Reserve a future fill without making earlier blocks ready."
msgstr "预留未来填充，不提前使更早的块就绪。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"O(1) task/IRQ. Failure leaves output and loss counters intact; only "
"explicitly observed boundaries justify note_loss."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。失败时输出和丢失计数不变；仅显式观测到边界后才可调用 note_loss。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Live posted producer"
msgstr "[inout] 活动的预提交生产者"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[out] Exact pending loan until FIFO publish or LIFO abort"
msgstr "[out] 精确的待完成借用，在 FIFO 发布或 LIFO 中止前有效"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "SUCCESS, OVERFLOW, STATE, EXHAUSTED or INVALID"
msgstr "SUCCESS、OVERFLOW、STATE、EXHAUSTED 或 INVALID"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Publish only the oldest pending detached producer loan."
msgstr "仅发布最早 pending 且已撤离引用的生产者借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "O(1) task/IRQ. Consumer acquire/release use the original stream."
msgstr "任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。消费者通过原有流执行 acquire/release。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Same exclusive producer as reserve"
msgstr "[inout] 与 reserve 相同的排他生产者"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Exact oldest token, absent from every hardware target"
msgstr "[in] 精确的最旧令牌，已从全部硬件目标中撤离"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Positive valid bytes at most the block capacity"
msgstr "[in] 正数有效字节数，最多为块容量"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Observed IDLE/TRIGGER/ERROR boundary facts"
msgstr "[in] 实际观测到的 IDLE/TRIGGER/ERROR 边界事实"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE; rejection retains the loan"
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID 或 STATE；拒绝时保留借用"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Cancel the newest pending fill after proof of memory drain."
msgstr "证明内存排空后，取消最新 pending 填充。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"O(1) task/IRQ. Does not advance consumer or published cursor; no FREE hole "
"appears ahead of future publication. Stopping closes admission but still "
"permits proved tail rollback."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ 中为 O(1)。不推进消费者或已发布游标，不会在后续发布位置前产生 FREE 空洞。停止会关闭准入，但仍允许经证明的尾部回滚。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[inout] Same producer; rollback is strictly LIFO"
msgstr "[inout] 同一生产者；回滚严格遵循 LIFO"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Exact newest pending token"
msgstr "[in] 精确的最新待完成令牌"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "[in] Source detached, no remaining writes"
msgstr "[in] 源已撤离，不再有剩余写入"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "SUCCESS, BUSY, STATE or INVALID; failure retains the loan"
msgstr "SUCCESS、BUSY、STATE 或 INVALID；失败时保留借用"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Caller-owned block metadata; initialize data and capacity only."
msgstr "调用者拥有的块元数据；仅初始化 data 与 capacity。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Storage remains live through producer and consumer quiescence."
msgstr "存储须保持有效，直到生产者和消费者均已静止。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Caller-owned stream control, initialized before publication."
msgstr "调用者拥有的 stream 控制，必须先初始化再发布。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"outstanding counts nonfree blocks, including filling, ready and borrowed "
"states. Only stream operations mutate it."
msgstr "outstanding 统计非空闲块，包括填充中、就绪和已借用状态。仅流操作可修改该计数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Mutable producer loan; hardware must stop before abort or publish."
msgstr "可变生产者借用；中止或发布前必须停止硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Optional caller-owned preposted producer; no default cost."
msgstr "调用者显式选择的预提交生产者，不产生默认成本。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid ""
"One serialized producer owns this control and the stream. Do not mix "
"ordinary reserve/publish/abort with a live posted producer. Two hardware "
"targets remain FILLING until detached. Publication is FIFO; rollback is LIFO"
" to avoid consumer holes."
msgstr ""
"一个串行化生产者拥有本控制对象及流。预提交生产者活动期间，不得混用普通 reserve/publish/abort。两个硬件目标在引用撤离前保持 "
"FILLING。发布遵循 FIFO，回滚遵循 LIFO，以免在消费者路径中留下空洞。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:71
msgid "Immutable consumer loan, valid until matching release succeeds."
msgstr "不可变消费者借用，直到匹配释放成功之前均有效。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:75
msgid "stream_budget.h"
msgstr "stream_budget.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "Optional constant-work snapshot and checked cold sizing."
msgstr "可选恒定工作量快照与经过检查的冷态容量计算。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "Snapshot maintained metadata under one short IRQ guard."
msgstr "在一个短 IRQ 临界区内快照维护的元数据。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ fixed work, no slot scan or payload access. Caller keeps all "
"storage alive; no observer reference is retained. next_free is the ordinary "
"stream cursor, not the private preposted cursor. Output is distinct from "
"every payload."
msgstr ""
"任务/IRQ 中的固定工作量，不扫描槽，也不访问载荷。调用方须保持全部存储有效；不保留观测者引用。next_free "
"是普通流游标，不是私有预提交游标。输出与全部载荷分离。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "[in] Live initialized storage, no concurrent destruction."
msgstr "[in] 已初始化的活动存储，不得并发销毁。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on rejected metadata/alias."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；元数据或别名检查拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE for inconsistent control facts."
msgstr "SUCCESS；控制事实不一致时返回 INVALID 或 STATE。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "Checked cold calculation, no stream mutation or allocation."
msgstr "经过检查的冷态计算，不修改 stream 或分配存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid ""
"required = targets + spares + ceil(rate*release_delay / "
"(block_units*1000000)); payload is required*block*unit_bytes. Finite math is"
" conservative under the declared FIFO frontier release bound; out-of-order "
"release may still block the next cursor. Latency requires target_delay_us < "
"floor(units_per_block*1000000/units_per_second). This creates no "
"backpressure or hardware qualification."
msgstr ""
"required = targets + spares + ceil(rate*release_delay / "
"(block_units*1000000))；载荷大小为 required*block*unit_bytes。在所声明的 FIFO "
"队首释放延迟界限下，此有限算术计算是保守的；乱序释放仍可能阻塞下一个游标。延迟要求 target_delay_us < "
"floor(units_per_block*1000000/units_per_second)。本计算不建立背压，也不构成硬件资格证明。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "[in] Explicit rate, longest release delay and pipeline."
msgstr "[in] 显式速率、最长释放延迟和流水线配置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "[out] Distinct output, unchanged on error or overflow."
msgstr "[out] 独立输出；错误或溢出时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED for arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID；算术溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "O(1) aggregate facts; free total does not imply cursor is free."
msgstr "O(1) 汇总事实；总空闲容量不证明游标位置空闲。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "Explicit engineering assumptions, no inferred hardware rate."
msgstr "显式工程假设，不推断硬件速率。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid ""
"release_delay includes queue/consumer delay until release of each published "
"FIFO frontier. units convert to bytes using unit_bytes. targets/spares are "
"actual selected hardware loans. All quantities are positive except "
"delay/targets/spares."
msgstr ""
"release_delay 包含每个已发布 FIFO 队首块直到释放为止的排队和消费者延迟。通过 unit_bytes "
"将单位转换为字节。targets/spares 是实际选择的硬件借用。除 delay/targets/spares 外，全部量均为正数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:77
msgid "Conservative declared-assumption budget; never physical evidence."
msgstr "依据声明假设得到的保守预算，绝不作为物理证据。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:81
msgid "stream_profile.h"
msgstr "stream_profile.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "Optional readonly continuous-stream cold admission profiles."
msgstr "可选只读的连续流冷准入配置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "Validate an actual pool before the bound UART may borrow it."
msgstr "绑定的 UART 借用缓冲池之前验证实际缓冲池。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"Caller joins all pool users before this cold pool check. Failure before "
"provider dispatch creates no borrow, epoch change or hardware effect. Rate, "
"FIFO-frontier hold and IRQ latency remain declared assumptions, never "
"measurements. This creates no external UART flow control or losslessness. "
"Underlying unprofiled APIs retain their explicit contracts."
msgstr ""
"调用方须在此次冷缓冲池检查前等待全部池用户退出。在 provider 派发前失败，不会建立借用、改变 epoch 或产生硬件副作用。速率、FIFO "
"队首持有时间及 IRQ 延迟始终是声明的假设，不是量测。本操作不建立外部 UART 流控，也不保证无丢失。底层未使用 profile 的 API "
"保留其显式契约。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "[in] Stable readonly reviewed binding and assumptions."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、只读且已经审核的绑定与假设。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"[inout] Initialized unborrowed pool with exact declared count and equal "
"declared byte capacities, kept live through the original provider's stop and"
" all consumer releases."
msgstr ""
"[inout] 已初始化且尚未借出的缓冲池，块数及各块字节容量与声明精确一致；须保持有效，直到原 provider 停止且全部消费者释放借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"INVALID for mismatched geometry/alias, STATE for stopping metadata, BUSY for"
" existing loans, CONTEXT outside an unmasked task, EXHAUSTED for "
"overflow/insufficient budget, UNSUPPORTED for target latency; otherwise "
"provider result."
msgstr ""
"几何或别名不匹配时为 INVALID；停止中的元数据返回 STATE；已有借用时为 BUSY；不在中断未屏蔽任务上下文中时为 "
"CONTEXT；溢出或预算不足时为 EXHAUSTED；目标延迟不满足要求时为 UNSUPPORTED；其余情况返回 provider 结果。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "Validate pool and whole-scan rate before ADC admission."
msgstr "ADC 准入之前验证缓冲池与完整扫描速率。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"ADC stopping its trigger creates a sampling gap. No budget makes that pause "
"preserve wall-clock samples or prove the future consumer/IRQ bounds. No "
"observer/queue is created."
msgstr ""
"ADC 停止触发会产生采样缺口。任何预算都不能使这一暂停保留按实际时间连续发生的采样，也不能证明未来消费者或 IRQ 的界限。不会创建观测者或队列。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "[in] Stable readonly binding to the selected ADC face."
msgstr "[in] 到所选 ADC 接口的稳定只读绑定。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "[inout] Initialized unborrowed exact pool, as for UART."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化且未借出的精确缓冲池，要求同 UART。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"[in] Positive nominal complete scans per second, no greater than the "
"declared production-rate upper bound."
msgstr "[in] 每秒完整扫描的正数标称次数，不大于所声明的生产速率上界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"Cold-check errors as for UART, or the original info/start result. Provider "
"scan, timer, DMA/cache and alias checks still apply; no rejected operation "
"retains new references."
msgstr ""
"冷检查错误同 UART，否则返回原 info/start 结果。provider 的扫描、定时器、DMA/cache "
"及别名检查仍然适用；任何被拒绝的操作都不保留新引用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "Selected UART face and immutable byte-stream assumptions."
msgstr "选定的 UART 接口与不可变的字节流假设。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"Reviewed assembly binds the actual continuous provider. Two hardware targets"
" and one replacement are required. A profile never allocates or owns the "
"caller's pool. The normal byte face and provider state retain their layouts."
" Cold admission rechecks payload disjointness in O(n^2); no additional check"
" enters the IRQ or steady I/O path."
msgstr ""
"已审核的装配绑定实际连续 provider。要求两个硬件目标及一个替补块。profile 不分配也不拥有调用方的缓冲池。普通字节接口及 provider"
" 状态布局保持不变。冷准入以 O(n^2) 重新检查载荷互不重叠；IRQ 或稳定 I/O 路径不增加额外检查。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid "Selected ADC face and complete-scan stream assumptions."
msgstr "选定的 ADC 接口与完整扫描流假设。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:83
msgid ""
"One unit is a complete selected scan, stored as one uint16_t per channel. "
"Resolution bits never replace storage width. Geometry and rates are reviewed"
" assembly inputs; they establish neither sample accuracy nor an aperture "
"time."
msgstr ""
"一个单位是一轮完整的所选扫描，每通道存储一个 "
"uint16_t。分辨率位数不能替代存储位宽。几何和速率是已审核的装配输入，不能据此证明采样准确度或孔径时刻。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:87
msgid "wake.h"
msgstr "wake.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Explicit borrowed IRQ wake target and syscall-ceiling check."
msgstr "显式借用 IRQ 唤醒目标与系统调用阈值检查。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Explicit kernel interrupt-mask policy, independent of any RTOS."
msgstr "显式内核中断屏蔽策略，独立于任何 RTOS。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Validate actual IRQ facts against an explicit kernel policy."
msgstr "依据显式内核策略验证实际 IRQ 事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid ""
"Cold check without attachment or callback effects. No kernel target is "
"accepted by NONE. PRIMASK permits every valid configurable IRQ with its "
"fixed zero priority group. Kernel-calling BASEPRI targets require the "
"maintained preemption grouping and a numerical priority at least the "
"ceiling. Nonkernel hints do not impose kernel grouping. Binding does not "
"authorize future CPU-context violations."
msgstr ""
"无绑定或回调副作用的冷检查。NONE 不接受任何会调用内核的目标。PRIMASK 在固定为零的优先级分组下允许全部有效可配置 IRQ。会调用内核的 "
"BASEPRI 目标要求已维护的抢占分组，且优先级数值不小于阈值。非内核提示不强制内核分组。绑定不授权后续违反 CPU 上下文要求的操作。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "[in] Optional immutable target; NULL disables notification."
msgstr "[in] 可选不可变目标；NULL 禁用通知。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "[in] Immutable validated CPU and kernel configuration."
msgstr "[in] 已验证的不可变 CPU 和内核配置。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "[in] External IRQ number, unshifted priority and group."
msgstr "[in] 外部 IRQ 编号、未移位的优先级及分组。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid ""
"Success, INVALID for malformed facts/target, PERMISSION for a kernel-calling"
" target in an unsafe interrupt domain."
msgstr "成功；事实或目标格式错误时返回 INVALID；会调用内核的目标处于不安全中断域时返回 PERMISSION。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Deliver one bounded hint after authoritative state is latched."
msgstr "权威状态锁存后发送一个有界提示。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid ""
"Task/IRQ as allowed by the target, no hidden task or retry. A failed wake "
"does not revoke state or request ownership."
msgstr "按目标允许的任务/IRQ 上下文执行，无隐藏任务或重试。wake 失败不撤销状态，也不撤销请求所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "[in] Previously validated live target or NULL."
msgstr "[in] 先前已验证的活动目标或 NULL。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Callback result, success for NULL, INVALID for a bad target."
msgstr "回调结果；NULL 返回成功；无效目标返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Optional immutable wake target borrowed by an IRQ provider."
msgstr "IRQ 提供者借用的可选不可变唤醒目标。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid ""
"notify runs in publisher context and must be bounded and legal in that IRQ. "
"Storage and context outlive all publishers. Stop and join publishers before "
"destroying the sink. A wake is only a hint; latched RX/request predicates "
"stay authoritative."
msgstr ""
"notify 在发布者上下文中运行，必须有界且在该 IRQ 中合法。存储及 context "
"须比全部发布者存活更久。销毁接收器前，须停止并等待发布者退出。wake 仅为提示；已锁存的 RX/请求谓词仍为权威依据。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Immutable CPU and kernel facts for cold wake binding."
msgstr "用于冷态唤醒绑定的不可变 CPU 与内核事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid ""
"NONE and PRIMASK require a zero syscall ceiling. BASEPRI requires a nonzero "
"unshifted ceiling. Configuration owns these facts; a wake target cannot "
"weaken them."
msgstr ""
"NONE 和 PRIMASK 要求 syscall 阈值为零。BASEPRI 要求非零且未移位的阈值。配置拥有这些事实；wake 目标不能放宽它们。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:89
msgid "Actual publisher facts read before attaching any borrowed sink."
msgstr "附加任何被借用的接收端之前读取实际发布者事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:93
msgid "traits.h"
msgstr "traits.h"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Public readonly traits of a selected I/O implementation."
msgstr "所选 I/O 实现的公共只读 traits。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Selected execution features, without physical qualification."
msgstr "所选执行特性，不建立物理资格。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Abort effects never release borrowed request or payload storage."
msgstr "abort 作用不释放借用中的 request 或 payload 存储。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Selected receive mechanism, without a throughput guarantee."
msgstr "所选接收机制，不提供吞吐保证。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Provider owns actual DMA admission and cache maintenance."
msgstr "provider 负责实际 DMA 准入与 Cache 维护。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Readonly transfer bounds of one selected implementation."
msgstr "所选具体实现的只读传输限额。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid ""
"Zero bounds mean unspecified, never unlimited. The typed interface defines "
"transfer units; zero unit_bytes means no fixed byte width. For Flash, "
"unit_bytes constrains destination offset and length while buffer_alignment "
"describes the caller's storage. Board wiring, memory domains, current state "
"and deadlines remain separate contracts."
msgstr ""
"限额为零表示未指定，不表示无限。强类型接口定义传输单位；unit_bytes 为零表示无固定字节宽度。对于 Flash，unit_bytes "
"约束目标偏移与长度，buffer_alignment 描述调用者存储。Board 接线、内存域、当前状态与 deadline 仍分别遵循各自合同。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Selected SPI transaction bounds in numeric words, not bytes."
msgstr "所选 SPI 事务限额，单位为数值 word，不是字节。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid ""
"Bit N of supported_word_bits permits N-bit words. Zero length bounds are "
"unspecified. These facts do not replace provider admission."
msgstr ""
"supported_word_bits 的 bit N 允许 N-bit word。零长度限额表示未指定。这些事实不替代 provider 准入。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Readonly uart facts for one selected implementation."
msgstr "所选具体实现的只读 uart 事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid ""
"Facts do not establish readiness, measured timing or physical qualification."
" Cache line bytes describe the selected provider policy, not whether cache "
"is enabled. UNKNOWN is not an unlimited guarantee. Parity zero means none; "
"stop_half_bits counts half-bit periods."
msgstr ""
"这些事实不证明 ready、实测时序或物理资格。Cache line 字节数描述所选 provider 策略，不表示 Cache 已启用。UNKNOWN"
" 不提供无限保证。parity 为零表示无校验；stop_half_bits 以半 bit 周期计数。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Readonly spi facts for one selected implementation."
msgstr "所选具体实现的只读 spi 事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid ""
"Facts do not establish readiness, measured timing or physical qualification."
" Cache line bytes describe the selected provider policy, not whether cache "
"is enabled. UNKNOWN is not an unlimited guarantee. configured_max_hz is a "
"requested ceiling, not a measured SCK rate."
msgstr ""
"这些事实不证明 ready、实测时序或物理资格。Cache line 字节数描述所选 provider 策略，不表示 Cache 已启用。UNKNOWN"
" 不提供无限保证。configured_max_hz 是请求上限，不是实测 SCK 速率。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid "Readonly i2c facts for one selected implementation."
msgstr "所选具体实现的只读 i2c 事实。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/io/execution.md:95
msgid ""
"Facts do not establish readiness, measured timing or physical qualification."
" Cache line bytes describe the selected provider policy, not whether cache "
"is enabled. UNKNOWN is not an unlimited guarantee. address_bits zero means "
"endpoint-selected width. nominal_hz is the selected divider result; zero "
"means no known physical rate."
msgstr ""
